///   </li>
///   <li>
///     <code>FileChatElement</code>: A file attachment (image, document, video, etc.).
///   </li>
///   <li>
///     <code>SystemChatElement</code>: A system-generated event (conversation started, ended, etc.).
///   </li>
///   <li>
///     <code>CarouselChatElement</code>: A horizontally scrollable set of rich cards.
