/// The primary entry point for integrating the Genesys Cloud chat experience into a host application.
/// <code>ChatController</code> manages the lifecycle of a chat session, including starting, ending, reconnecting,
/// and presenting the chat UI. The host application creates an instance with a configured <code>MessengerAccount</code>
/// and assigns a <code>ChatControllerDelegate</code> to receive lifecycle callbacks.
